{"4239390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Planet Paycheck", "steam_appid": 4239390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/85f5a733e125b8d5d3e66f1b0ead0f22.avif?t=1777340204\" width=768 height=96 /></span></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready to gamble, build guns, kill things, gather resources, and upgrade your research base, with Friends of course!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/729962f605d9ff7b741dcec478e831ef.avif?t=1777340204\" width=387 height=371 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/cafa3c26132024f18b04cd081a0169de.avif?t=1777340204\" width=387 height=371 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/bf60378aa5a472d5198d219a6cafebe9.avif?t=1777340204\" width=387 height=371 /></span></strong> <strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/ca793c7341f0ffc9e0bf5c0bdea9fde3.avif?t=1777340204\" width=387 height=371 /></span></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/10146b635e687f79486eb7e0ad4ff4e3.avif?t=1777340204\" width=768 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New turn of the millennia technology sanctioned by our greatest big spenders, allows use of the modified R.A.T (Rotary Acquisition Terminal), once purposed for delivering food creations, has been adapted by the greatest minds in the empty colonies to turn scrap into useful parts for building weapons of your hopefully achievable dreams.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/3ad8568fe3b484ca00ba0a356e037f34.avif?t=1777340204\" width=387 height=371 /></span></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/005f212e1bdc6a80d5c7f6e31e08e1f1.avif?t=1777340204\" width=768 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One the vital parts of a weapon are acquired, make your way over to the S.A.W.D (System Automated Weapon Designer). to turn that once useless scrap, now useful parts into even more useful tool for scrap extraction*</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Scrap extraction involves the firing of custom built weapons to remove potentially useful scrap from hostile creatures and robots.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/3a673f10251e16192184550ab65daf22.avif?t=1777340204\" width=387 height=371 /></span></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/5d92edf93a177bbc453c023e1c27b6e6.avif?t=1777340204\" width=768 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After visiting the R.A.T, the S.A.W.D, and gathering some amount of friends (optional) you will find yourself needing to interact with the M.A.P (Mission Access Panel). to plan an excursion into a new zone to gather scrap and research data for the development of the colony. All matter of research is needed to evolve the tools, weapons, and base for your mission.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/0ac810effcfb9c2116484a9a567de0ec.avif?t=1777340204\" width=387 height=371 /></span></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Now get out there, and get Looting, Shooting and Gambling. For The Paycheck!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/24af65a5a9640c351a650ce21af3c6fb.avif?t=1777340204\" width=387 height=371 /></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/85f5a733e125b8d5d3e66f1b0ead0f22.avif?t=1777340204\" width=768 height=96 /></span></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready to gamble, build guns, kill things, gather resources, and upgrade your research base, with Friends of course!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/729962f605d9ff7b741dcec478e831ef.avif?t=1777340204\" width=387 height=371 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/cafa3c26132024f18b04cd081a0169de.avif?t=1777340204\" width=387 height=371 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/bf60378aa5a472d5198d219a6cafebe9.avif?t=1777340204\" width=387 height=371 /></span></strong> <strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239390/extras/ca793c7341f0